	(text "S-100 level shifters: 5 V TTL bus (right, A port) <-> 3.3 V FPGA (left, B port). 74ALVC164245: DIR high = A->B (towards the FPGA), OE low = enabled. Control inputs are referenced to VCCA (5 V) and accept 3.3 V levels (VIH 2.0 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d4a2a53-029c-4e7c-951b-a87c4247fd80")
	)
	(text "LS_BUS_DIR / LS_BUS_OE* come from the FPGA (pull-ups: towards FPGA, disabled). U7 half 2 (PHI, pHLDA, PWAIT, CLOCK, PINTE) is always enabled so the clocks keep running during DMA. Unused channels of enabled halves are tied to 0 V through 10 k on both sides."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 17 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eee77504-254e-445f-97e4-8c575e19f910")
	)
	(text "U5: address A0-A15"
