	(text "Open-collector lines (wired-OR): BSS138 bidirectional open-drain translator per line. FPGA side pulled to 3.3 V (10 k), bus side pulled to 5 V (2.2 k, the MPU-A used 1 k). The FPGA drives '0' or 'Z' only. MWRT and SSW_DSB* are inputs to the FPGA; the stage simply shifts them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7e68382-f702-43b5-a181-7e078c922389")
	)
	(text "IMSAI: pin 53 is SSW DSB* (front panel forces data onto the processor bus), not ground. RDY = PRDY, XRDY = front panel RUN/STOP, SLAVE_CLR* = EXT CLR, RESET* = PRESET."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 126 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a2cdd5c7-cbed-44fc-acdc-149c49adb514")
	)
